## Do not

- Fake catalog products named “Basic” / “Premium” only for search.
- Scrape all `app/stickers/**` files — use CMS `subcategoryItems` + fixed legal/help pages.
- Point subcategory search at PDP unless the query matches a real product.
- Show inactive subcategory pages in search while cards hide them (one-sided UX).

